{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00597","headline":"郊庙歌辞 享龙池乐章 第八章 · 李乂","name":"郊庙歌辞 享龙池乐章 第八章","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"星分邑里四人居，水洊源流万顷余。\n魏国君王称象处，晋家藩邸化龙初。\n青蒲暂似游梁马，绿藻还疑宴镐鱼。\n自有神灵滋液地，年年云物史官书。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李乂","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00597.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00597","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}